      "text": {
        "jp": "あの二人、「のばら」の旗の前で\r\n革命を誓ったと言っていたしな。",
        "official_en": "I remembered Simon saying he swore an oath together with Dario in front of the Wild Rose flag.",
        "real_en": "They said they'd sworn to carry out the revolution in front of the Wild Rose flag."
      },
